<title>USA: Great Lakes Chemical Corp Q4 net off.</title>
<headline>Great Lakes Chemical Corp Q4 net off.</headline>
<dateline>WEST LAFAYETTE, Ind. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.62		    $1.15</p>
<p> Net			 37,771		   74,611</p>
<p> Revs		     515,440		  564,959</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  62,272		   64,751</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $3.94		    $4.52</p>
<p> Net			250,296		  295,573</p>
<p> Revs		   2,211,704		2,361,069</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  63,538		   65,364</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 and yeat nets reduced by $15 million net effect of several one time-items, including $28 million in write-offs, adjustments to reserves and other non-recurring expenses, and $13 million one-time gain from sale E/M unit.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
